{
  "slug": "ai-operations-consultant",
  "name": "Ai Operations Consultant",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Most AI readiness tools give you a questionnaire and a score. The DOI Method gives you a structured engagement — maturity scoring, role verification, outcome mapping, task classification, friction analysis, and a sequenced implementation roadmap. The same methodology behind 50+ client engagements, packaged as a Claude plugin.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **12 skills** and **1 agent**.\n\n- **Skills** (12): `doi-assess` (Use when conducting the 30-question digital operations maturity assessment), `doi-engage` (Use when running the full DOI pipeline end-to-end after intake + routing), `doi-friction` (Use when scoring friction on classified tasks using the Three C's framework (Consistency, Clarity, Capacity)), `doi-intake` (Use when starting a new DOI engagement), `doi-outcomes` (Use when mapping role-level outcomes after verification), `doi-pillars` (Use when scoring a department's foundational pillars (Talent Strategy, Workflow Optimization, Digital Architecture) and advanced pillars (Knowledge Management,…), `doi-roadmap` (Use when building the final implementation roadmap for a department), `doi-roles` (Use when analyzing a verified role — extracts tasks by frequency, classifies each into the 4-stage AI automation…), and 4 more\n- **Agents** (1): `doi-review`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install ai-operations-consultant@claude-community` from `3rd-Brain/AI-Operations-Consultant`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 12,
    "agent": 1
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
